{"id":1061204,"name":"マルガリータ・取り調べⅣ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"マルガリータ・取り調べⅣ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061204]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61204,"stage":"段階4","unlock_time":"2026-02-14 05:00:00","diary1":"事態の急変にも、マルガリータは動じることなく、笑みで刃を隠しながら局面を操ろうとする。だが、あなたの言葉は刃となり、彼女の美辞麗句を一枚ずつ剥ぎ取っていく。\n　仮面が滑り落ち、柔らかな光が消え去ったその先で、彼女はついに偽りの純粋さを捨てた。空虚な平和理念の下に隠されていたのは、彼女の本心、露骨な陽動、そして不敗を支える切り札だった。","diary2":"マルガリータの「平和」とは、妥協の美徳ではなく、掌握の技である。彼女にとって、他人は織物の中の刺繍糸であり、盤上の駒にすぎない。\n　たとえ目標が一致していても、あなたは彼女に局面を任せることはない。影にどれほどの秘密が潜もうとも、あなた自身が駒を動かすのだ。","evidence":[{"ID":260883,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260884,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161204022,"next":null},{"st